---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Contact & Free Quote
heading: Contact Us & Get a Free Quote
crumbLabel: Contact
eyebrow: Contact
description: Contact O.L Services for a free chimney, fireplace, dryer vent or air duct cleaning quote in Sacramento. Call (916) 940-9693.
intro: The fastest way to reach us is by phone. You can also send your details below, and we'll give you a clear, no-obligation quote.
heroCta: false
permalink: /contact/
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="container contact-inner">
    <div class="contact-info">
      <div class="aside-card">
        <h2>Call us</h2>
        <a class="contact-phone" href="{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a>
        <p>Call to ask a question, get a quote or schedule a visit.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary btn-block" href="{{ site.phoneHref }}">
          {% include "partials/icon-phone.njk" %}
          Call Now
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="aside-card">
        <h2>Where we work</h2>
        <p>Based in Sacramento, serving the greater Sacramento area:</p>
        <p class="area-inline">
          {%- for a in site.areas %}<a href="/service-areas/#{{ a.id }}">{{ a.name }}</a>{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor -%}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="aside-card">
        <h2>Before you call</h2>
        <p>It helps to know:</p>
        <ul class="check-list">
          <li>What kind of fireplace, stove or vent you have</li>
          <li>When it was last cleaned or inspected, if you know</li>
          <li>Anything you've noticed, such as smells, smoke, leaks or long dryer times</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="form-title">Request a free quote</h2>
      {% include "partials/quote-form.njk" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-tint" aria-labelledby="map-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Service area map</p>
      <h2 id="map-title">Serving Sacramento and surrounding cities</h2>
    </header>
    <div class="map-frame">
      <iframe
        title="Map of the greater Sacramento area"
        src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=Sacramento,+CA&z=9&output=embed"
        loading="lazy"
        referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
        allowfullscreen></iframe>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
